# Route: guide 44 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to 59, 40
# quests, 1.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thousand Needles, Tanaris, Un'Goro Crater, The Barrens, Stranglethorn
# Vale): The Shimmering Flats -> Steamwheedle Port -> Gadgetzan -> Broken
# Pillar -> Gadgetzan -> Abyssal Sands -> Steamwheedle Port -> Gadgetzan ->
# Steamwheedle Port -> Gadgetzan -> Lakkari Tar Pits -> The Marshlands ->
# Lakkari Tar Pits -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Super Snapper FX (2944;
# Gammerita 48).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Crone of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770),
# Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll Temper (3042), Into the
# Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527),
# The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets (4788), Mortality Wanes (1142),
# Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard
# (6981).

